WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:11.820
This time, it's me. I'm the one who killed Hina.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.100
Both Akkun and Chifuyu are going to die!

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.670
What's the point of yelling?!

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.550
I was saved by you!

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:29.860
Please change the world of the villain, Akumishi-kun!

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.930
I'll save you all!

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.200
What?!

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:43.160
They're all here.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:49.130
That was a good idea.

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:52.010
I'll take it.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.750
It's huge!

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:57.580
Wait, I saw that somewhere.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:00:58.720
Huh?

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.580
I thought I saw it somewhere.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:03.860
Takemichi Hanagaki?

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:04.640
Huh?

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:05.910
What is it?

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:08.810
Aren't you in a good mood now that you're the captain?

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.230
The second vice-captain.

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:14.700
Shiba inu Hakkai

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:16.260
What?

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:17.840
The second team is...

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:18.980
What are you doing?

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:20.730
Let's go home.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:22.010
Shoot!

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.290
RAIN is calling me!

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:26.550
Why are you still calling me?

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:28.950
I have to play at least 10 games.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.070
I don't want to throw it.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:32.710
Use it for something else.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:35.980
It's a waste of time to come here, isn't it?

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.630
This guy!

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:43.280
You're so noisy.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:45.740
You're a child.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.230
Black Dragon!

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:50.550
What's wrong?

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.390
Oh, well...

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:56.160
I often hear about you from the captain.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.750
Why is the Black Dragon team...

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.440
The vice-captain of Toman?

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:04.400
What's going on?

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:00.780
You

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.490
The 11th generation of Black Dragon's leader,

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.010
Shiba Hak-

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.850
Rumor has it that the money-

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.450
It's a bastard who killed his brother-in-law for me and took the Black Dragon.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:06.640
Killing someone for me?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:12.830
Azudora said so, but...

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:20.840
You're tall and stylish.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.310
Hina!

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:23.930
What?

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:41.120
Hehe

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:33.900
Thank you.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:45.190
I think Shiba-kun is better at dropping pins.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.730
Yeah, his ball is the heaviest.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.350
What!?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:57.940
18 pounds!

00:05:58.220 --> 00:05:58.980
He's a pro!

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:34.190
What?

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:47.300
It's the power!

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:49.920
Look!

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:52.130
This!

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:53.340
Yes!

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:54.280
That's it!

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.030
W-what a speed!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.200
Next time, do you want to play table tennis?

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.180
What are you talking about?

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:28.290
I'm not here, so I'm going home.

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.480
Sorry. His reaction was funny.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:36.610
So, we're siblings from now on.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.720
Takemichi, come to my house right now.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.560
Y-Yes.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.320
Chiba Hakkai...

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.740
I might have fallen in love with a bad guy.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.720
If you and him are siblings,

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.260
it means you're my sister's younger brother.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.900
Huh? We're siblings?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.310
Go buy some juice.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.680
Huh? If you ask me...

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:00.610
It's a little similar to the eyes.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.580
You look weak to fight.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:06.520
Why are you wearing a long-sleeved uniform?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:08.540
Ugh...

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:11.330
What I'm worried about...

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.640
No matter how you think about it, Hakkai is the one who stands above you.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.720
This guy doesn't feel that way at all.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:18.740
That's right.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.600
Shiba-kun looks strong.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:21.780
Hina!?

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:21.920
What?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.080
You're really no good.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:36.520
It's a pain in the ass just to think about standing on top.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:38.720
It's a mess.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:41.560
I like freedom.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:45.540
This guy.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:57.050
Oh, Hina.

00:08:57.190 --> 00:08:58.090
Don't get me wrong.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:08:59.980
My brother is a good guy.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.880
It's a weird thing to do.

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:01.520
Huh?

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:06.030
If you talk to girls other than me, you'll freeze.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:07.230
Huh?

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:09.720
Don't worry about it.

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.070
Ah, yes.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.490
Hahaha, Pongkotsu.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:23.120
Is he that Shiba Hakkai?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.840
Rumor has it that he killed his brother for money and took the Black Dragon.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:31.810
That's what Kazutora-kun said.

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.150
The future leader of the Black Dragons?

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:37.830
Thank you for watching.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.280
I don't think he's a bad guy.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.200
Right now, at this point...

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.480
Vice-Captain of the 2nd Brigade of Toman.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:48.550
What happened in the past 12 years?

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:53.060
Um...

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:54.050
Hm?

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:55.300
Mr.Hokkai

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.530
So you're the vice-captain of the second squad?

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.860
Captain, Mitsuya-kun and...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.260
Are you two friends?

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.100
I don't know.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.200
By the way,

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.340
stop being polite to me because I'm Tame.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.440
What?

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:08.970
With that appearance?

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.210
Tame and I?

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:10.970
Hahaha.

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.230
You're mean.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.200
For Hakkai,

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:15.600
Mitsuya is like an older brother.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.760
Taka-chan is

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.480
a thorn in my eye.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.870
I was beaten up

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.730
by the uncoolness

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.050
and the uncoolness of the bad boys.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.030
Taka-chan?

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.460
I see.

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:29.860
Mitsuya's...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.160
Was his name Takashi?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.660
Shut up, that guy.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:40.890
He's like an older brother.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:46.820
This guy's love for Mitsuya is abnormal.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.460
Look at this guy's phone.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.940
I don't want to!

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:53.900
When did you...

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:55.680
The receptionist is Mitsuya.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.850
By the way, mine is Hakkai.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.800
Oh my god!

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:06.460
But somehow...

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:07.540
It suits you.

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:10.830
But in the future...

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:14.580
The Black Dragon group led by this Hakkai...

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:16.510
With Kisaki...

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:17.750
They're training the Toman members.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:19.500
What the hell is that?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.600
Give it back to me.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:22.440
Yes, yes.

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:29.370
In the future, it is unknown where it will go.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.680
Mitsuya-kun too

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:33.170
Don't tell me this guy is...

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.740
I was waiting for you to take a photo of me.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.440
Shiba Hakkai...

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:40.900
We've only just met, but...

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.280
The destruction we saw in the future...

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:44.860
I can tell that he's a different person.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:48.870
Something has changed this guy.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:53.370
What happened?

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.340
I don't know what's going to happen from now on, but...

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.260
If we stop that...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.420
In the future, the black dragon will be gone.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:04.960
Takemichi!

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:06.110
Let's go!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:07.280
I'll be there soon.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:07.810
Huh?

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:09.810
Ugh!

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.200
Go ahead.

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:20.410
I don't like it.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.410
Thank you for your viewing.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.330
Thank you for your viewing.

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:29.270
Aniki...

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:31.790
They're coming back.

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:32.310
What?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.110
They look like they're in trouble.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.960
BD.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.000
What the hell?

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.390
Hanagaki

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:03.770
Yeah?

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.690
Wally

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.200
Come home with me today

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:08.670
What?

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:10.930
This is...

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:14.810
You're still young

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:15.690
What?

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:24.610
This is also the former Black Dragon of the future

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:30.340
Thank you for watching.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:31.820
These guys...

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:33.380
It's the Black Dragon!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:42.620
Who the hell are you?

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:43.870
That guy...

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:44.960
I've seen it before.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.320
Tohman no Ichiban Tai-taichou

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:48.180
I'm hungry.

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:51.200
I'm going to the island of death!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:54.200
Stop it!

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:00.720
Toman?

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.870
You're the captain?

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:07.780
What? You're in trouble all of a sudden?

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.030
You can't get out of my island alive!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:12.630
You must be prepared.

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:17.520
Are you the rumored Hanagaki?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.240
The captain of the first squad of the Tokyo Manjikai.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.990
The Golden Rookie with the power to knock down birds.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:28.560
All of this is the bloodline of us Black Dragons.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.210
The boss is telling the boss to kill the other team members around here.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:39.730
You know what this means, don't you?

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.690
Hanagaki?

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:48.150
I mean, die!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:56.970
You guys, go ahead and do it.

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:02.020
Hina-chan, back off.

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:06.290
These guys don't even show mercy to women.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.140
Stop it! Takemichi is my brother-in-law!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:11.900
Young man.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.560
No matter how young of a friend you are, you have to be strong.

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:18.810
Our guys don't listen to what you say.

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:21.560
Is this guy that flower boy?

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:24.380
He looks weak to me.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:26.450
Isn't the captain a lie?

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:28.460
I'll do it and make him pay.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.160
That's not good. We don't need this many.

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.580
Damn it! What should we do?

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.460
Even though Kina is here...

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:40.350
I told you not to mess with me, didn't I?

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:42.190
I'm begging you.

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:45.320
Huh? So this guy knows Black Dragon?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.660
Hakkai, you heard me, didn't you?

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.990
We can't listen to what you say.

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:54.930
You want to fight a girl too?

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:05.560
Go home, Castamon!

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:09.160
He's so strong!

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:20.400
I'm sorry to hear that, Takemichi.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:25.990
The boss of these Black Dragons is Shiba Taiju.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.380
What? Shiba?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.740
That's right. Taiji is our big brother.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.600
We are three brothers.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:37.980
What?

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.670
Is Hakkai's big brother the leader of the Black Dragons?

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:42.990
What?

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.320
Where is your big brother?

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:48.420
At the convenience store.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:52.720
I don't even feel like going back to 6th floor.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.130
At a time like this...

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:58.660
You're getting in my way.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:16:59.280
Hey.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:04.290
Don't get carried away.

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:05.940
Thank you for watching.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.560
If you underestimate the boss, I'll kill you!

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:11.570
It's not peaceful.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.380
You think you can't do it?

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.490
Don't you dare touch my little brother!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.380
Stop it, NB. You're Boss's brother.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:42.120
I swear loyalty to Boss, but I don't have the guts to fight them.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:44.550
I'll tell you who's superior.

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.730
It doesn't matter if it's a girl or not.

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.800
I'll kill all of you!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:54.220
No, not at all.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:56.800
Greed is fundamentally...

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.950
Seriously, you're crazy!

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:19.960
I'm sorry, Hanagaki. This is our problem. Leave this to me, and you run away.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.920
Hina-chan, please protect me.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:29.600
What should I do? They are really dangerous, but I have to protect my sister.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:37.150
I can't let Hina stay in this place anymore.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:51.280
Hina, let's go!

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:22.720
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:30.620
Ah...

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:33.760
Kina...

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:35.610
I...

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.520
I can't...

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:36.830
I...

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:37.290
Ah...

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:37.910
You guys suck.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:45.160
You look like you're having fun.

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.830
I'll join you!

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:55.600
Hehehehehehehehehehehehehehehehe

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:56.600
EEEEYAH!

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:00.570
Shut up!

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:01.090
Bro!

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:11.280
This is the 10th generation Black Dragon's leader!

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:25.360
Even Kurito can't move the people who were alive until now.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:28.860
So? Who is this guy?

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.250
I didn't know you were hitting me.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:35.990
As expected of Boss.

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:39.690
He is the best captain of Touman.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.960
Takemichi Hanagaki.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:45.040
Huh? Touman?

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:49.900
He is the captain of Touman?

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:53.150
Coco, that's an interesting joke.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.180
It's true, Boss.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:56.900
It's like a young fish.

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.140
That's ridiculous!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:17.920
So, Hakkai, did you bring some bad guys to my house?

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.260
No matter how much I tell you, you won't come to my house!

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:39.040
Hakkai, beat this guy to death!

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:59.180
Hey, didn't you get over it?

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:03.430
Kill him!
